The controlled scan changes now charge work inside family, position-list, entity decode, and whitespace normalization loops, and the production text path uses them. I also added the offset-aware outline entry point and routed production geometry through the authored run offset; request-level conversion now pins any later geometry diagnostic to that run. Compilation has caught up cleanly after small fixes. Next I’m tightening test coverage and then I’ll record exact remaining status for publication if the current API change cannot be completed without crossing the ownership boundary.
