The locked offline check and test suite both pass with the current edits; the suite reports 60 passing integration tests. The required work-order validator also passes. I have not yet closed the publication finding: the callback still owns `ShapeAdmission` and performs append, so the bypass remains structurally possible. I’m updating the work artifacts to distinguish the implemented controlled scans/offset propagation from the still-open callback contract, and will record the requested checks exactly.
