/bin/zsh -lc "cat > artifacts/WO-RUST-SVG-MEDIA-01/result.md <<'EOF'
Partial remediation candidate. Preserved the archived initial candidate (20/20 seed hashes verified), all inherited fixes/tests, and 60 passing focused cases. Added controlled WorkControl charging inside production font-family, position-list, XML entity scan, and whitespace-normalization loops. Production text requests route through those variants. Added "'`text_path_geometry_at` and route production outline generation through the authored text run offset; late geometry diagnostics are remapped to that offset. Existing fixes remain: scalar word-spacing, one-time dx/dy, Text versus CDATA entity handling, checked fallible pending-space reserve, and finite cursor validation.

Verification: `CARGO_HOME="$PWD/.cache/cargo" cargo +stable check -p vexel-svg-media --locked --offline` passed; same command with `test` passed, 60 integration tests. `python3 scripts/wo_validate.py WO-RUST-SVG-MEDIA-01 --ready` passed.

